# Paleta de Kyu en Shipwreck: colores desde el wallpaper (pisa el source = "custom" de odyssey.toml).
# El estado de la GUI (~/.local/state/noctalia/settings.toml) sigue ganando sobre este archivo.
[theme]
source = "wallpaper"
wallpaper_scheme = "soft"

[theme.templates]
builtin_ids = [ "foot", "kcolorscheme", "niri", "qt" ]
community_ids = [ "zen-browser", "thunar" ]

[wallpaper]
directory = "{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/Pictures/Wallpapers"

[wallpaper.default]
path = "{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/Pictures/Wallpapers/wallhaven-2eqjdy.png"
